    {
      "source": "principal ruling 2026-10-08 (relayed by CTO #582): 'Remove it everywhere, amend the hash'",
      "date": "2026-10-08",
      "id": "RR-1",
      "change": "removed the llm_key_source record (secret-store name, organisation project slug, environment name, home project and a cross-project flag; no secret value) from the run record and the run manifests",
      "rationale": "not load-bearing for any claim: a key's storage location tells a referee nothing about validity, and the fields name an organisation project, an environment and a cross-project key practice that a DOI would make permanently citable",
      "not_removed": "llm_cache_dir and llm_cache_namespace (/biofm_cache/...) are container paths naming the public repository's cache volume, not an organisation, environment or key practice",
